:: Moor Dragons Detour
<<effects>>

You turn and walk down an alternate path. This one isn't quite so scary.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Moor Dragons Continue
<<effects>>
<<rng>>
You continue your journey.

<<if $rng gte 100>>
	<<beastNEWinit 3 dragon>>
	It's just a feeling, after all.
	<br><br>
	You hear the stomping of feet behind you. You turn, and face a pair of red eyes. You hear more feet. You're surrounded.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		A <<beasttype 0>> tackles you, <span class="purple">pinning you to the ground.</span> "I'm glad you're here," <<bhe 0>> says. "Such a boring day." <<bHe 0>> leaps away instead of pressing the attack. You rise to your feet, and get pinned by <<bhis 0>> friend.
		<br>
	<<else>>
		A large dragon tackles you, <span class="purple">pinning you to the ground.</span> It growls at you a moment, but then backs away. You rise to your feet, only to be tackled by a second dragon.
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Fight|Moor Dragons Rape]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Submit|Moor Dragons Rape]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 95>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 dragon>>
	It's just a feeling, after all.
	<br><br>
	You hear the stomping of feet behind you. You turn, and face a pair of red eyes.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		A <<beasttype>> tackles you, <span class="purple">pinning you to the ground.</span> "I'm glad you're here," <<bhe>> says. "Such a boring day."
		<br>
	<<else>>
		A large dragon tackles you, <span class="purple">pinning you to the ground.</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Fight|Moor Dragon Rape]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Submit|Moor Dragon Rape]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	It's just a feeling, after all, and you soon leave it behind.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Moor Dragons Rape
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>

	<<beastTrainGenerate>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<if $NPCList[0].penis isnot "none">>
			You remain on your knees as the <<beasttype 0>> mounts you.
			<<set $position to "doggy">><<set $NPCList[0].stance to "top">>
		<<else>>
			The <<beasttype 0>> flips you onto your back, and mounts you.
			<<set $position to "missionary">><<set $NPCList[0].stance to "top">>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You kick the <<beasttype 0>> away from you. <<bHe 0>> hisses.
		<<set $enemyanger += 30>><<set $enemyhealth -= 100>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Moor Dragons Rape End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Moor Dragons Rape End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Moor Dragons Rape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Moor Dragons Rape End
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<beastwound>>
	<<if $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
		The <<beasttype>> recoils in pain and fear, but another is eager for a go.
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Moor Dragons Rape]]>><<set $finish to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		The <<beasttype>> recoils in pain and fear.
		<br><br>
		<<tearful>> you struggle to your feet.
		<br><br>
		<<clotheson>>
		<<endcombat>>
		<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	<<if $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
		Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> moves and another takes its turn.
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Moor Dragons Rape]]>><<set $finish to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> moves away from you.
		<br><br>
		<<tearful>> you struggle to your feet.
		<br><br>
		<<clotheson>>
		<<endcombat>>
		<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<tearful>> you struggle to your feet.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Moor Dragon Rape
